{#
    Site search's results page (SR-2) in the theme's `search` layout. Search engines are asked not to list it, and
    to follow its links. `head`, the HTML the modules listening to PublicScreenRendering escaped, is printed by core's
    head partial (`@seo/head.html.twig`), which every theme's shell includes.
    Context: what SearchHandler gives the layout (`title`, `query`, `total`, `results`, `pagination`, `state` …).
#}
{% extends 'layouts/search.html.twig' %}
{% block head %}<meta name="robots" content="{{ robots }}">{% endblock %}
